{
  "about": [
    "The two Task status models, and the one conversion between them, written as data.",
    "",
    "Both evaluators replay it. `src-tauri/tests/operations/task_status_conformance.rs` runs every case",
    "through `Status::converted`; `src/utils/task-status-conformance.test.ts` runs the same cases",
    "through `convertedStatus`, which the Task editor uses to show the status a flag change would",
    "leave. Neither side generates this file.",
    "",
    "`models` lists each model's statuses. A case names a status, the model a Task of kind `agentic`",
    "holds, and its counterpart there \u2014 itself when it is already in that model \u2014 or null when it has",
    "none: an ordinary Started has none in the Agentic model, and On Agent (Review included) none in",
    "the ordinary one. See `docs/spec/resources.md`, *Agentic statuses*."
  ],
  "models": {
    "ordinary": [
      "todo",
      "in_progress",
      "started",
      "done"
    ],
    "agentic": [
      "todo",
      "on_agent",
      "review",
      "doing",
      "done"
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "todo"
      },
      "agentic": false,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "todo"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "todo"
      },
      "agentic": true,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "agentic",
        "status": "todo"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "in_progress"
      },
      "agentic": false,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "in_progress"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "in_progress"
      },
      "agentic": true,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "agentic",
        "status": "doing"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "started"
      },
      "agentic": false,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "started"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "started"
      },
      "agentic": true,
      "converted": null
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "done"
      },
      "agentic": false,
      "converted": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "done"
      }
    },
    {
      "status": {
        "kind": "ordinary",
        "status": "done"
